-*   **Feature Vector ($\mathbf{v}_s$):** A 64-dimensional vector sampled from volume $V_s$ at point $\mathbf{p} \in \mathbb{R}^3$ using trilinear sampling $S(V_s, \mathbf{p})$ [S1]. No positional encoding is applied to $\mathbf{v}_s$ [S1].
