-    $$
-    \gamma(p) = [\sin(2^0\pi p), \cos(2^0\pi p), \dots, \sin(2^{L-1}\pi p), \cos(2^{L-1}\pi p)]
-    $$
-    This results in a higher-dimensional representation passed to the radiance function [S1].
